(text "LAYOUT: PCIe Gen3 pairs are 85-ohm differential; for this on-board PCIe device, place C500-C503 beside U500 per the Mu guide and route over an uninterrupted reference plane." (at 20.32 350.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid c7015f52-cb59-5748-ae6c-7e8b69762b24))
(text "LAYOUT: MDI pairs are 100-ohm differential. Put U501/U502 immediately behind J500, avoid stubs, and do not route digital signals under the magnetics." (at 20.32 358.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 12609da8-7601-54bc-a094-21f01c7d8d65))
(text "MECHANICAL: manufacturer body 17.58 x 26.06 x 11.30mm; PCB/panel plane is 2.03mm behind the front face; panel opening 17.98 x 9.69mm." (at 20.32 365.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid a51a40a4-ae59-5ad5-899d-edd66120aaf5))
(text "RELEASE HOLD: verify all four unnumbered shell stakes are common and confirm LED copper lands on one physical JXD1 sample before ordering the motherboard." (at 20.32 373.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 568a84e7-a4a4-5062-be03-72eee261b268))
(text "ASSEMBLY HOLD: ask the assembler to confirm through-hole mid-mount RJ45 support and whether J500 is manual/post-reflow insertion." (at 20.32 381 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 46aee68d-723e-56cb-a098-1da6feea4bac))
